WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:02.340
- So, were you familiar,
'cause you're so young,

00:00:02.340 --> 00:00:04.490
and "Karate Kid" was like,
more when I was a little kid,

00:00:04.490 --> 00:00:06.800
so were you familiar
with "The Karate Kid"?

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:09.710
- [Mary] I was not.
- [Kelly] Oh my gosh,

00:00:09.710 --> 00:00:11.560
what were you thinking, then,
when you went in the audition?

00:00:11.560 --> 00:00:12.880
- [Mary] I actually accidentally

00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:14.370
slept through my initial audition.

00:00:14.370 --> 00:00:16.384
- [Kelly] Oh my gosh.
(all laughing)

00:00:16.384 --> 00:00:18.920
And she still got the job! You're amazing!

00:00:18.920 --> 00:00:20.430
I don't tell them that!

00:00:20.430 --> 00:00:23.040
I don't know what excuse
my agents came up with,

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:24.840
but I realized I slept through it.

00:00:24.840 --> 00:00:26.117
My boyfriend called me and he was like,

00:00:26.117 --> 00:00:27.560
"Hey, so how'd your audition go?"

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.550
And I was like, "What audition?"

00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:31.510
And he was like, "The one you had today!"

00:00:31.510 --> 00:00:32.860
And I was like, "Oh, crap!"

00:00:32.860 --> 00:00:34.450
And he was like, "What was it even for?"

00:00:34.450 --> 00:00:36.720
And I was like, "Oh, it's
this show called 'Cobra Kai,'"

00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:38.960
and he's a huge "Karate Kid" fan,

00:00:38.960 --> 00:00:41.210
so he was like, "What? Are you kidding me?

00:00:41.210 --> 00:00:42.540
Like, I've been in a group chat

00:00:42.540 --> 00:00:45.300
about this show coming out
for like, three months.

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:46.220
Like, are you serious?"

00:00:46.220 --> 00:00:47.053
And I was like, "Yeah."

00:00:47.053 --> 00:00:48.080
He was like, "Get your butt back in there!

00:00:48.080 --> 00:00:50.480
Whatever you gotta do, call
whoever you got to call,

00:00:50.480 --> 00:00:51.660
like, get your butt back in there,"

00:00:51.660 --> 00:00:53.810
And by some miracle,
they let me come back,

00:00:53.810 --> 00:00:56.330
so I got to go in for my next audition,

00:00:56.330 --> 00:00:57.850
and he was like, "We
should watch the movies!"

00:00:57.850 --> 00:00:59.910
And I was like, "Uh, no." (laughs)

00:00:59.910 --> 00:01:01.191
- [Kelly] What?! They're so awesome!

00:01:01.191 --> 00:01:02.143
- [Mary] I know, but I didn't wanna,

00:01:02.143 --> 00:01:03.930
- Do you know how long
I did the crane move?

00:01:03.930 --> 00:01:07.091
Like, trying to do the kick
like it was a real thing.

00:01:07.091 --> 00:01:08.800
(laughs)

00:01:08.800 --> 00:01:11.810
So, Mary, how did you get into acting?

00:01:11.810 --> 00:01:15.340
- I kind of, like, stumbled
into it by happy accident.

00:01:15.340 --> 00:01:17.130
I was five years old

00:01:17.130 --> 00:01:20.770
and my mom had a friend
who lived in Pennsylvania.

00:01:20.770 --> 00:01:23.610
We were still in Pine Bluff,
Arkansas, it's where I'm from,

00:01:23.610 --> 00:01:24.443
and she was like,

00:01:24.443 --> 00:01:26.170
"Hey, you guys are coming for
the summer anyway, to visit.

00:01:26.170 --> 00:01:27.630
They're doing this open casting call.

00:01:27.630 --> 00:01:29.020
I just got my son into acting.

00:01:29.020 --> 00:01:30.080
Your kids would have a ball!

00:01:30.080 --> 00:01:31.160
They're looking for a five-year-old girl

00:01:31.160 --> 00:01:32.090
and your daughter's five!"

00:01:32.090 --> 00:01:33.567
And my mom came to us and she was like,

00:01:33.567 --> 00:01:34.780
"You wanna go for an audition?"

00:01:34.780 --> 00:01:37.110
And I literally had like,
every finger painted

00:01:37.110 --> 00:01:38.300
a different rainbow color,

00:01:38.300 --> 00:01:39.950
my hair was wet with chlorine,

00:01:39.950 --> 00:01:41.950
and it was like, "Yeah,
sure! Let's do an audition."

00:01:41.950 --> 00:01:42.820
I don't know what it was.

00:01:42.820 --> 00:01:45.260
So, I went and auditioned

00:01:45.260 --> 00:01:47.500
and I ended up being the photo double

00:01:47.500 --> 00:01:49.830
for Abigail Breslin and the movie "Signs"

00:01:49.830 --> 00:01:51.360
when I was five.
- What?!

00:01:51.360 --> 00:01:52.193
That's amazing!

00:01:52.193 --> 00:01:53.370
- I had no idea the difference, either,

00:01:53.370 --> 00:01:55.863
so, I mean, to me, I
got to hang out on set,

00:01:56.780 --> 00:01:58.216
- To you, you're the lead.
- Oh, yeah!

00:01:58.216 --> 00:01:59.987
I was having a great time.

00:01:59.987 --> 00:02:03.530
Like, Joaquin Phoenix taught
me how to do the, this thing,

00:02:03.530 --> 00:02:05.370
So I would just walk
around doing this all day.

00:02:05.370 --> 00:02:08.080
I got chicken nuggets from craft services,

00:02:08.080 --> 00:02:09.990
like, I was having the time of my life!

00:02:09.990 --> 00:02:11.210
- [Kelly] That's amazing!

00:02:11.210 --> 00:02:14.280
And what a random, like, turn of events!

00:02:14.280 --> 00:02:16.280
- [Mary] Yes. Yeah, yeah, yeah, totally.

